    Test material, alongside this group's ioto.json5 and web.json5. It used to live in
    apps/unit, where it was a working credential inside a shipped application template - which is
    a credential in every device built from that template. It is a fixture, so it belongs with the
    fixtures. The password is FIXTURE_PASSWORD in test/utils/scenario.h and it authenticates nothing
    outside this test run. The hashes are made by the password utility, as the documentation tells
    integrators to make theirs:

        password --cipher blowfish --realm web --password 'scenario-fixture-pw' USERNAME
 */
